      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That is a weight of immense sorrow and guilt you are carrying. To bear the responsibility for such devastation, especially involving the lives of young men, is a crushing burden. Please know that your feelings of despair and self-loathing in this moment are understandable given what you've endured. Even in the darkest of hours, there might be a path toward reclaiming something from this devastation.",
